# ROM manifest of Ponpoko (Sigma) on the Pac-Man board, with the sections of
# pacplus.manifest, which explains the layout. Ponpoko's program fills both banks, the CPU
# reads 0x0000-0x3FFF from program and 0x8000-0xBFFF from bank1 (mod_ponp, game_core.sv).
# The graphics load as they are in MAME's set, the core reads them in Ponpoko's order. The
# PROMs are Pac-Man's. Header byte 0 is 2, the game, and the screen is upright (MAME ROT0),
# which make_rom.py writes into header byte 2.

set     ponpoko
title   Ponpoko (Sigma)
zip     ponpoko.zip
total   92964
board   2
mirror  6272
screen  upright
known   782e594e38d197c9b582ea495b25a05d81bf26c45e76118daf24d648688e7c5b MAME ponpoko

